@startuml
title UC4 - Join Virtual Queue

start

:Select service to join queue;
:Submit join queue request;

if (Is queue available?) then (Yes)
  :Create queue entry;
  :Assign queue number & position;
  :Display queue number and position;
else (No)
  :Show queue unavailable message;
endif

stop

note right
Activity Description:

1. Customer selects the service to join the virtual queue.
2. Customer submits a request to join the queue.
3. System checks whether the queue is available.
4. If available, the system creates a queue entry.
5. System assigns a queue number and position.
6. System displays the queue number and current position.
7. If the queue is unavailable, the system shows an error message.
end note

@enduml